  "title": "Modernizing Communications For Mission-Critical Networks",
  "summary": "Mission-critical networks are changing fast.Utilities, transport operators, and critical infrastructure providers are under pressure to deliver more data, more automation, and more resilience—without ever compromising reliability.The challenge is simple: legacy SDH/SONET networks were built for a different era.They still deliver reliability.But they can’t support what comes next.Drivers for ChangeModern OT (operational technology) networks are being reshaped by three forces:",
